Maintainer: Arnaud Kientz <arnaud@linuxmuster.net>
Changed-By: Lukas Lukic-Spitznagel <lukas.spitznagel@netzint.de>
Description:
 linuxmuster-tools7 - Tools for the linuxmuster.net 7 server.
Changes:
 linuxmuster-tools7 (1:7.4.21~edu) lmn74; urgency=high
 .
   * Merge upstream 7.4.21 (security release). Upstream notes:
   * [security] [ldapconnector] The value of /search is escaped in the
     LDAP filter.
   * [passwords] Random first passwords use PWD_LENGTH of school.conf,
     and a diceware passphrase with RANDOM_PWD = dice.
   * [print] All LaTeX special characters are escaped, and the school is
     forwarded when printing a schoolclass list.
   * [samba] smbstatus is read from its json output, with the school
     prefix and the users of a room.
   * Minor fixes: expired certificates, malformed sophomorix log lines,
     drives without properties, custom fields imported from the webui,
     gzipped logs, hostname and room of machines.
   * edulution fork: this build keeps the LMNFile change of 1:7.4.20~edu1,
     which still allows the webui paths until the webui is removed.
